        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Joseph, Dauphin of France; Marie Antoinette; Louis XVI of France\n- Roles: Dauphin of France; Queen of France\n- Places: France\n- Events: French Revolution\n\nFacts:\n- Marie Antoinette was born as Maria Antonia Josepha Johanna on 2 November 1755.\n- Louis Joseph de France, also called Louis Joseph Xavier François, was born on 22 October 1781.\n- Louis Joseph, Dauphin of France, was the second child and elder son of King Louis XVI of France and Marie Antoinette.\n- Marie Antoinette was the last Queen of France before the French Revolution.\n- Louis Joseph de France died on 4 June 1789.\n- Marie Antoinette died on 16 October 1793.",
